{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“超迹”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"超迹"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p>设 $A$ 是 $\\mathbb Z_2$-分次 Hilbert 空间 $\\mathscr H^{\\pm}$ 上的迹类算子, 保持奇偶, 那么其超迹 $\\operatorname{str}A$ 定义为\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{str}A=\\operatorname{tr}_{\\mathscr H^+}A-\\operatorname{tr}_{\\mathscr H^-}A.\r\n$$</p>\n"}}